menu "e32p: pm"

    config E32P_PM_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_pm (low-power sleep + wake sources)"
        default n
        help
            Low-power facade over esp_sleep: configure wake sources (timer, ext0,
            ext1, GPIO, touch), enter light or deep sleep, and report the wake
            cause with a friendly enum. Adds argument validation and RTC-pin
            checks over the raw API. Light sleep returns and is unit-tested
            on-target; deep sleep resets the chip. No other e32p modules required.

endmenu
